                "A lifeguard pulls a 3-year-old girl out of the pool. She does not respond and is not breathing. Another lifeguard calls 911 and sends someone for the AED. You are the next trained person to help."
              ],
              "sceneTitle": "At the community pool",
              "options": [
                {
                  "id": "ob76fe",
                  "text": "Wait for the AED to arrive before touching her so nothing is done out of order."
                },
                {
                  "id": "obbd29",
                  "text": "Give only rescue breaths and check her pulse every minute until EMS takes over."
                },
